  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      328.51,
      451.2,
      347.18
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3: This clause amends section 8 of the principal enactment by specifying theprocedure to be followed in the destruction of a dangerous animal.",
