      181.77,
      227.45,
      381.93,
      251.03
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE DANGEROUS ANIMALS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 49 )",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      264.05,
      401.91,
      287.63
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      300.65,
      401.89,
      324.23
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Dangerous Animals(Amendment) Act, No. of 2022.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      337.25,
      401.89,
      409.67
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 7 of the Dangerous Animals Ordinance(Chapter 49) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended in paragraph (a) ofsubsection (4) of that section by the substitution for thewords \u201cone thousand rupees\u201d, of the words \u201ctwo hundredand fifty thousand rupees\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      422.69,
      401.9,
      470.63
    ],
    "text": "3.Section 8 of the principal enactment is herebyamended by the substitution for the words \u201cthe court willproceed to take measures for carrying such order intoexecution.\u201d, of the following:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      191.85,
      483.65,
      401.87,
      507.23
    ],
    "text": "\u201cthe court will proceed to take measures for carryingsuch order into execution:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      191.85,
      520.25,
      401.91,
      617.03
    ],
    "text": "Provided however, the destruction of the animalshall only be carried out in a humane manner with nopain or suffering caused to the animal by a registeredveterinary surgeon or registered veterinarypractitioner or any other person referred to inparagraph (b) of subsection (2) of section 32 of theVeterinary Surgeons and Practitioners Act, No. 46 of1956.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      630.05,
      401.9,
      653.63
    ],
    "text": "4.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
